{"task_id": "Mbpp/108", "solution": "from typing import List\ndef merge_sorted_list(list1: List[int], list2: List[int], list3: List[int]) -> List[int]:\n    # Input validation\n    for lst in (list1, list2, list3):\n        if not isinstance(lst, list):\n            raise TypeError(\"All arguments must be lists.\")\n        if not all(isinstance(x, int) for x in lst):\n            raise TypeError(\"All list elements must be integers.\")\n    # Merge and sort\n    return sorted(list1 + list2 + list3)"}
