{"task_id": "Mbpp/447", "solution": "from typing import List\ndef cube_nums(numbers: List[int]) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\"Return a new list containing the cubes of the integers in ``numbers``.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    numbers : List[int]\n        A list of integers to be cubed.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    List[int]\n        A list containing the cube of each integer from ``numbers``.\n        The order of elements is preserved.\n\n    Examples\n    --------\n    >>> cube_nums([1, 2, 3])\n    [1, 8, 27]\n    >>> cube_nums([-1, 0, 2])\n    [-1, 0, 8]\n    \"\"\"\n    return [n ** 3 for n in numbers]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n: int, max_cache: int = 0) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculate the cumulative sum of Perrin numbers from index 0 to n inclusive.\n\n    Parameters:\n        n (int): Non\u2011negative index of the Perrin sequence.\n        max_cache (int, optional): Maximum number of intermediate Perrin values to cache.\n                                   0 disables caching beyond local variables.\n\n    Returns:\n        int: Sum P(0)+P(1)+...+P(n).\n\n    Raises:\n        ValueError: If n is negative.\n        TypeError: If n or max_cache is not an int.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"n must be an integer\")\n    if not isinstance(max_cache, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"max_cache must be an integer\")\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be non\u2011negative\")\n    if max_cache < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"max_cache must be non\u2011negative\")\n\n    # Handle trivial cases\n    if n == 0:\n        return 3\n    if n == 1:\n        return 3  # 3 + 0\n    if n == 2:\n        return 5  # 3 + 0 + 2\n\n    # Initialize first three Perrin numbers\n    p0, p1, p2 = 3, 0, 2\n    total = p0 + p1 + p2  # sum of first three terms\n\n    cache = []  # optional cache for intermediate Perrin numbers\n    cache.append(p0)\n    cache.append(p1)\n    cache.append(p2)\n\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        pi = p0 + p1  # recurrence: P(k) = P(k-2) + P(k-3)\n        total += pi\n\n        # Store in cache if needed\n        if max_cache > 0:\n            if len(cache) < max_cache:\n                cache.append(pi)\n\n        # Shift values for next iteration\n        p0, p1, p2 = p1, p2, pi\n\n    return total"}
