{"task_id": "Mbpp/451", "solution": "def remove_whitespaces(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Remove all whitespace characters from the input string.\n\n    Parameters:\n        s (str): The string from which to remove whitespace.\n\n    Returns:\n        str: A new string with whitespace removed.\n\n    Raises:\n        TypeError: If 's' is not a string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(s, str):\n        raise TypeError(f\"Expected str, got {type(s).__name__}\")\n\n    return ''.join(ch for ch in s if not ch.isspace())"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "def sum_of_even_factors(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return the sum of all even divisors of a positive integer n.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    n : int\n        A positive integer (n >= 1). Raises ValueError for non\u2011positive or non\u2011integral input.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    int\n        Sum of all even divisors of n. If n has no even divisors, returns 0.\n\n    Examples\n    --------\n    >>> sum_of_even_factors(18)\n    26\n    >>> sum_of_even_factors(1)\n    0\n    >>> sum_of_even_factors(2)\n    2\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be an integer\")\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer\")\n\n    total = 0\n    limit = int(n**0.5)\n    for i in range(1, limit + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            d1 = i\n            d2 = n // i\n            if d1 % 2 == 0:\n                total += d1\n            if d2 != d1 and d2 % 2 == 0:\n                total += d2\n    return total"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/454", "solution": "import re\nfrom typing import Iterable, Optional\n_WORD_PATTERN: re.Pattern[str] = re.compile(r\"\\b[a-zA-Z]+\\b\")\n_Z_PATTERN: re.Pattern[str] = re.compile(r\"z\", re.IGNORECASE)\ndef _tokenize(text: str) -> Iterable[str]:\n    \"\"\"Yield all alphabetic words from *text*.\"\"\"\n    return _WORD_PATTERN.finditer(text)\ndef _contains_z(word: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Return True if *word* contains 'z' or 'Z'.\"\"\"\n    return bool(_Z_PATTERN.search(word))\ndef text_match_wordz(text: Optional[str]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Determine whether *text* contains at least one word with the letter 'z' or 'Z'.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    text : str or None\n        Input string to evaluate. If ``None`` it is treated as an empty string.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    bool\n        ``True`` if any alphabetic word in *text* contains 'z' or 'Z', otherwise ``False``.\n\n    Raises\n    ------\n    TypeError\n        If *text* is not a string (and not ``None``).\n    \"\"\"\n    if text is None:\n        text = \"\"\n\n    if not isinstance(text, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"text_match_wordz expects a string input\")\n\n    for match in _tokenize(text):\n        if _contains_z(match.group()):\n            return True\n\n    return False"}
