{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Compute the sum of decimal digits of a non\u2011negative integer.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    n : int\n        A non\u2011negative integer whose decimal digits will be summed.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    int\n        Sum of the decimal digits of ``n``.\n\n    Raises\n    ------\n    TypeError\n        If ``n`` is not an instance of :class:`int`.\n    ValueError\n        If ``n`` is negative.\n\n    Examples\n    --------\n    >>> sum_digits(0)\n    0\n    >>> sum_digits(123)\n    6\n    >>> sum_digits(987654321)\n    45\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(\"n must be an int\")\n    if n < 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be non-negative\")\n\n    total = 0\n    while n:\n        total += n % 10\n        n //= 10\n    return total"}
