{"task_id": "Mbpp/618", "solution": "from typing import List, Union\nimport numbers\ndef div_list(numerator: List[Union[int, float]],\n             denominator: List[Union[int, float]]) -> List[float]:\n    \"\"\"Perform element\u2011wise division of two numeric lists.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    numerator : list\n        List of numbers (int or float) to be divided.\n    denominator : list\n        List of numbers (int or float) used as divisors.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    list of float\n        Division results for each element pair.\n\n    Raises\n    ------\n    TypeError\n        If inputs are not lists or contain non\u2011numeric elements.\n    ValueError\n        If input lists have different lengths.\n    ZeroDivisionError\n        If any denominator element is zero.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_inputs(numerator, denominator)\n    return [float(a) / float(b) for a, b in zip(numerator, denominator)]"}
