{"task_id": "Mbpp/638", "solution": "def wind_chill(V: float, T: float) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Compute the wind chill index using the AMS formula.\n\n    Args:\n        V (float): Wind velocity in kilometres per hour (km/h).\n        T (float): Temperature in degrees Celsius (\u00b0C).\n\n    Returns:\n        int: Wind chill index rounded to the nearest integer.\n\n    Formula:\n        WC = 13.12 + 0.6215*T - 11.37*V**0.16 + 0.3965*T*V**0.16\n    \"\"\"\n    v_pow = V ** 0.16\n    wc = 13.12 + 0.6215 * T - 11.37 * v_pow + 0.3965 * T * v_pow\n    return int(round(wc))"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/639", "solution": "def sample_nam(names: list[str]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return the sum of the lengths of the names that start with an uppercase letter.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    names : list[str]\n        A list of names to process.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    int\n        The total length of names that start with an uppercase letter.\n\n    Examples\n    --------\n    >>> sample_nam(['sally', 'Dylan', 'rebecca', 'Diana', 'Joanne', 'keith'])\n    16\n    \"\"\"\n    return sum(len(name) for name in names if name and name[0].isupper())"}
